    "body": "## Bugs\r\n\r\n- [ ] 1 char trailing delim completions not working (they do after backspacing delim but not on forward typing)\r\n- [ ] => delim completion doesn't work, bc of pat sort maybe\r\n- [ ] in fact example in probes slide, pinning (say) the `6` sample of `fact(x-1)` doesn't align other samples\r\n\r\n## Summary\r\n- Pin-gated strict arrow navigation for probes; preserves sightline when capture perspective extends up an ap chain\r\n- Pin icon restyle: white circle with red 1.5px stroke, shared rule in `proj-probe.css`\r\n- Multi-pin bug fix: pin icon was appearing at multiple breadcrumbs in recursive calls (via `is_suffix_of` in `SampleFocusBar.re`)\r\n- TyDi: allow 1-char completion for backpack trailing delimiters\r\n\r\n## Notable commits\r\n- Preserve sightline when capture perspective-extends up an ap chain\r\n- Pin-gated strict arrow navigation for probes\r\n- Extract `is_reachable_pinned` helper + unit tests\r\n- Unify pin icon style: white circle with red stroke, shared rule\r\n- Fix pin icon appearing at multiple breadcrumbs in recursive calls\r\n- TyDi: allow 1-char completion for backpack trailing delimiters\r\n\r\n## Known issue\r\n- TyDi backpack 1-char completion: tests pass, but the live editor does not work for the `case` arrow. Tracked locally.\r\n\r\n## Test plan\r\n- [ ] `Test_Evaluator_ProbeNav` (new, 217 lines)\r\n- [ ] `Test_TyDi` additions (~64 lines)\r\n- [ ] Visually verify pin icon in recursive call breadcrumbs\r\n- [ ] Manually exercise pin-gated strict arrow nav\r\n",
